@author "Claude (Anthropic)"

; fish-base vertex: O = incenter of triangle abd, a point ON the ac-diagonal.
; The letters and (staying .c) leave two states, one with its emergent ray
; beside .b and one beside .d. `(emergent beside .b)` (this file) and its
; sibling `(emergent beside .d)` pick the two MIRROR realizations: two
; different folds.
;
; `.bel` assertions have no vocabulary for the layer order (see
; tests/test_bel_assert.ml's `assertion` type), so `faces = 6` is all this
; file can pin; the DIFFERENCE (this file's layer order vs. -toward-d.bel's)
; is pinned by tests/test_flatten.ml's
; test_flatten_derive_opposite_ray_fish_base, which reads Fold_state.order
; directly and asserts the two runs disagree.

paper square

mark (map .a onto .c) as --diag
mark (through .a .c) as --ray

mark (map --ab onto --diag) as --l1
mark (map --da onto --diag) as --l2
flatten (--l1 valley) (--l2 valley) (--ray & .a valley) (staying .c) (emergent beside .b)

; assert faces = 6
